              "text": "rēgnō, rēgnāre — \"to reign, to be king\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Senex rēx multōs annōs rēgnāvit. The old king reigned for many years."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "rēgnō, rēgnāre, rēgnāvī, rēgnātum, from rēgnum (taught). English reign."
            }
