              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "dictātor, dictātōris — \"a dictator\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In magnō perīculō senātus dictātōrem creāvit. In great danger the senate appointed a dictator."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine, 3rd declension. The Roman dictator held full power in an emergency, for six months only."
            }
          ]
        },
